    "body": "## What does this implement/fix?\n\n| Property | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Method | `importUnencryptedNotes` |\n| Class | `com.omaawr.tuisku.managers.PortManager` |\n| File | `app/src/main/kotlin/com/omaawr/tuisku/managers/PortManager.kt` |\n| Specification | `ZipSlipSpec` |\n| Analysis tool | `static:manual` |\n\n## Summary\n\nCanonicalize the import root and each candidate output path before creating FileOutputStream. Process only paths equal to the root or beneath it using a separator-bounded comparison. Move ZIP entry advancement outside conditional processing so all nonexceptional paths progress.\n\n## How was this tested?\n\n- No automated test was added in this change\n- [x] Project compiles successfully (`assembleDebug`)\n- [ ] Confirmed by a project maintainer\n\n## AI assistance\n\n- [x] AI assistance was used for this contribution.\n- [ ] Apply the repository's required AI-assistance label.\n\n## Additional context\n\nI’m an undergraduate Computer Engineering student at the University of Brasília (UnB), and this contribution is part of a research project involving static analysis of Android apps.\n\nI’m happy to adjust the implementation to better match the project’s architecture, coding conventions, or maintainers’ recommendations.",
